# Expertise (otherAreas 4): the available check and Take's conditions, bracketed. His Name is Valgeir accepted (a GM): its
# section (Take 65), none of this quest's. Completed (a GM), Quest[4][3]DayCompleted 7992 (7992 + 8 = 8000, not below):
# 65; 7991 with Windurst fame 124 (level 2): 65; fame 125: 61; the quest made completed by a GM while it is open: no
# section, nothing (DayCompleted stays 7991). Available again (a GM): 61, finished with option 1: begun all the same
# (any option), DayCompleted 0. The accepted section's status operand alone: Prog 3 (a GM) and the bisque while completed
# (a GM): Take's default 59, not 62.
lists Mhaura/Take/onTrigger Mhaura/onEventFinish/61 Mhaura/onEventFinish/62
char zone=Mhaura pos=22.1,-8,69.8 job=WAR lvl=30
quest OtherAreas.HisNameIsValgeir accepted
fame Windurst 125
login
trigger Take                            # His Name is Valgeir accepted: 65; no Expertise section
finish
quest OtherAreas.HisNameIsValgeir completed # a GM
charvar Quest[4][3]DayCompleted 7992    # 8000 < 8000 false
trigger Take                            # 65
finish
charvar Quest[4][3]DayCompleted 7991    # 7999 < 8000
fame Windurst 124                       # level 2
trigger Take                            # 65
finish
fame Windurst 125                       # level 3
trigger Take                            # 61
quest OtherAreas.Expertise completed    # a GM, while 61 is open
finish                                  # no section while completed: nothing (DayCompleted stays 7991)
quest OtherAreas.Expertise available    # a GM
trigger Take                            # 61
finish option=1                         # any option: DayCompleted 0, begun
charvar Quest[4][4]Prog 3               # a GM
keyitem LandCrabBisque                  # a GM
quest OtherAreas.Expertise completed    # a GM
trigger Take                            # completed: no section (The Clue off below fame level 5): 59
finish
